/-! A finite differential-operator certificate for the skewness-refined Langevin inequality.
The integer polynomials were generated by D²−a² with a=1,3,5, eight steps each.
Lean verifies every differential identity, initial value, and terminal sign.
No generated arithmetic is trusted without its kernel-checked identity. -/

@[expose] public section
set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
open Polynomial
namespace ENT.Quantitative
open ENT.Pang
noncomputable section

